  rcaTerritorialCoverageParagraph1: 'If you hold an RCA insurance policy, throughout its validity period you automatically benefit from Green Card coverage valid in European Union member states, as well as in Iceland, Norway, Liechtenstein, Switzerland, Serbia, Albania, Andorra, Moldova, Turkey, Ukraine, Azerbaijan, Belarus and Montenegro, without paying any additional premium.',
