  claimsHtml023: "If the event occurred in Romania (regardless of the location: public roads, roads closed to traffic, premises, etc.), involved two vehicles with valid MTPL insurance, and resulted only in property damage to the two vehicles, with no bodily injury, the drivers may jointly complete the Amicable Accident Report form without the intervention of the authorities empowered to investigate such events. This enables Axeria IARD's representatives to determine the liability of the drivers involved and the damage caused. Completing this form does not constitute an admission of liability by either driver; it records the events and facts needed to settle the claim files.",
