  cookiePolicySectionThreeTitle: "3. How can I refuse cookies?",
  cookiePolicySectionThreeDescription: "On your first visit to the Site, you will be informed that you have the option of objecting to the storage of cookies that are incidental to the operation of the Site, in particular by refusing to accept them via the cookie banner. You may change your preferences at any time by clicking this button",
  cookiePolicySettingsButton: "Cookie settings",
